The Slug shader in shaders/slug.frag (and its CPU mirror in
lib/src/reference.dart) is a port of the reference Slug shaders:

  https://github.com/EricLengyel/Slug
  Slug shader code Copyright 2017 by Eric Lengyel.

The Slug algorithm: Eric Lengyel, "GPU-Centered Font Rendering Directly
from Glyph Outlines", Journal of Computer Graphics Techniques (JCGT),
vol. 6, no. 2, 2017. The Slug patent (US 10,373,352) was dedicated to the
public domain on 17 March 2026.

The reference shaders are dual-licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0; this port uses
them under the MIT License:

